row?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0051\", \"v\": [[\"umm what photos did I, uh, take this month?\"], [\"Could you please show me the photos I took this month?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0052\", \"v\": [[\"Jathoe Lido photos?\"], [\"Could you show me what photos I have from Jathoe Lido, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0053\", \"v\": [[\"I need to drop someone a line and can't find it anywhere, so what's Iskander Rivas's email again?\", \"Unrelated, but I was trying to remember the other day, when am I next seeing Piotr?\", \"My weekdays are packed as it is, so could you move both of them to saturday?\"], [\"Iskander Rivas email?\", \"next seeing Piotr when?\", \"move both to saturday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0054\", \"v\": [[\"I think I've let things slide a bit, so for tasks due last week, how many have I got?\", \"Separately, I'm trying to square up with everyone, so how much do I owe Antoine Czarnecki?\", \"Also, it feels like it's been ages, so when was I last in touch with Lucasta?\", \"And I want to feel a bit productive, so what did I tick off last weekend?\", \"Actually scrap that, I'll have a look myself later when I've got a minute.\"], [\"last week tasks, how many?\", \"owe Antoine Czarnecki how much?\", \"last in touch with Lucasta?\", \"ticked off last weekend?\", \"scrap that, I'll check later\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0055\", \"v\": [[\"For last week, could you tell me which tasks were due, please?\", \"Thank you. And how many of them are there, please?\"], [\"umm last week, which tasks were due, like... which ones have I got?\", \"ok and, uh, how many is that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0056\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you show me photos from Jathoe Lido?\", \"oh wait hang on, when am I next at Kinsale Tearooms?\", \"ok back to the lido ones, uh, just the ones from last month?\"], [\"I want to show a friend how nice it was there, so could you find the photos taken at Jathoe Lido?\", \"Hang on, before I forget, I need to plan around it, so when am I next at Kinsale Tearooms?\", \"Right, back to the lido pictures, there are too many, so just the ones from last month please.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0057\", \"v\": [[\"who do I owe?\", \"just Dietrich\"], [\"I'm trying to clear my debts before things pile up, so who do I owe money to at the moment?\", \"Actually I only care about one of them right now, so can you narrow that down to anything about Dietrich?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0058\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out what everything cost, so what did the night come to in the end?\", \"Another thing, I want to keep track of who I talk to. Raffaella and I had a call, could you log it?\", \"Sorry, should've said, it was Raffaella Ramsay.\"], [\"what did the night come to\", \"had Raffaella on a call, log it pls\", \"the Raffaella Ramsay one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0059\", \"v\": [[\"pull up the rudder close-up thing pls\", \"whos coming to the walk\", \"can u undelete the tadpole task\", \"move both Antoine things to tuesday, the task and the calendar one\", \"last month, what did i put in my diary?\"], [\"I was trying to show someone the boat pictures, so can you pull up the rudder close-up thing?\", \"I'm trying to figure out numbers, so who is coming to the walk?\", \"I binned something by mistake, so could you undelete the tadpole task for me?\", \"My week's shifted around a lot, so could you move both Antoine things, the task and the calendar entry, to tuesday?\", \"I'm trying to remember how I was feeling back then, so from last month, what did I write in my diary?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0060\", \"v\": [[\"Regarding Raffaella in salmon collective, would you please settle up for me?\", \"Also, could you tell me who I'm seeing at the chiropodist, please?\"], [\"Raffaella, salmon collective, settle up\", \"chiropodist, who?\"]]}","ttft_ms":35433,"type":"result","duration_ms":51006,"uuid":"50a93574-5486-4c28-8214-e06c94c2912f","ttft_stream_ms":1716,"time_to_request_ms":171,"first_content_frame_ms":1717,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22645519,"warm_spare_claime